Cell[TextData[{
 "From the FullForm output we see that this double struck letter serves as a \
container which has at least 2 arguments. First, ",
 StyleBox["mvDownUp[List[1],List[]]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 "  contains list of down and up indices, respectively. The second ",
 StyleBox["Cl[3,0,0]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " contains the algebra name.  This from we should keep in mind if we want to \
construct more complicated patters that matches basis elements. Basis \
elements that depend to different algebras can be distinguished by color, \
which is automatically assigned  inside",
 StyleBox[" gaDefineOrthonormalBasis[]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " call."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3153db58-9345-461d-be5e-69fb3cc44d36"],

