}, Closed]],

Cell[TextData[{
 
 CounterBox["Section"],
 ".",
 
 CounterBox["Item"],
 "\t",
 StyleBox["Span",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". Let V \[Element] \[DoubleStruckCapitalV] be a set of arbitrary vectors in \
a vector space \[ScriptCapitalV] . V is a spanning set, Span (V), if any \
vector can be written as a linear combination of vectors in V . Usually, Span \
(V) is a set of all possible linear combinations of vectors from V . Any \
vector that belongs to V, i . e ., a \[Element] V, can be constructed from a \
linear combination, for example, of basis vectors ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
        StyleBox["i", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\mathrm{e}_i", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4c611bc1-40fa-4bd8-83bd-a072324482f2"],
 " multiplied by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
        StyleBox["i", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\alpha_i", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d6d97416-ae40-46d0-8164-ddabb91a451d"],
 " \[Element] \[DoubleStruckCapitalR], or \[DoubleStruckCapitalC], or \
\[DoubleStruckCapitalH], ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "1"], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", FontSlant -> "Plain"], "1"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", "2"], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", FontSlant -> "Plain"], "2"], "+", "\[CenterEllipsis]",
          "+", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Alpha]", 
          StyleBox["n", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
          StyleBox["n", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "a=\\alpha_1\\mathrm{e}_{1}+\\alpha_2\\mathrm{e}_{2}+\\cdots+\\alpha_n\\\
mathrm{e}_{n}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1109293f-7e7c-4a9b-a396-8b1e9681c8b3"]
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{
  3.910234949567009*^9},ExpressionUUID->"0de30352-882c-4c2f-ac48-\
c50a0588bd07"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 
 CounterBox["Section"],
 ".",
 
 CounterBox["Item"],
 "\t",
 StyleBox["Subspace.",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 " If V is a nonempty set of vectors in a vector space \
\[DoubleStruckCapitalV], then the Span (V) is a subspace of \
\[ScriptCapitalV], i . e ., Span (V) \[Element] \[ScriptCapitalV] . For \
example, two non-collinear vectors ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["a", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "a", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2e37396b-01a2-405c-8981-d30017d4447f"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["b", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "b", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "48616513-860d-4857-a464-94a2b05148c5"],
 " make up a subspace called the plane in a larger vector space \
\[DoubleStruckCapitalV]. The Span (V) also may consist of all vector space."
}], "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9102349556591454`*^9, 
  3.910234957089203*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"31830c24-0a69-4e4e-bc95-\
b1b5ed040062"],

