Cell[TextData[{
 "Here the second line expands the constructed product. Full name of ",
 StyleBox["gaPE[]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " command is ",
 StyleBox["gaProductExpand[]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ", but since the command is so often used we always use a short form. Other \
products can be computed in a similar fashion. Check that above generated \
list of random vectors (grade-1 multivectors) are indeed linearly dependent."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a729687c-6a79-4137-ae5c-c2393a8ae4b4"],

