Cell[TextData[{
 "in fact gaOrthonormalBasis[] is just container which was computed by \
command ",
 StyleBox["gaDefineOrthonormalBasis[]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 ". Note, that each computed basis has some ordering (in this case \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]InvDeg[Lex]\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote], for details see \
end of this notebook). It is easy to check that the basis is orthogonal and \
normalized."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a81e3984-2d89-4fbc-b8f7-c2524b897dfa"],

