Cell["\<\
In general in literature on Clifford algebras notion and definitions of \
norms/magnitudes often are confusing, since for general multivectors (not \
pure vectors, or some other specific multivectors) the above definitions are \
not well suited or useful. The only true norm for general MV is \
gaNormDeterminant[ ], which we will describe later. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"12a70a0f-68d6-4cbc-8a88-d48ec974669b"],

