Cell["\<\
Clifford algebra is identified by 3 indices p,q and r as full form shows. At \
the moment of writing it deals only with nondegenerate  r=0 algebras. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.911964079148862*^9, 
  3.911964321154182*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e2fe4a72-16fa-44bc-aca2-\
