    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b77e244a-17f6-4ced-982f-96eb51f156ab"],
 " algebra having the positive signature, so that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\mathrm{e}_{}^i=\\mathrm{e}_{i}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5ff410ff-955d-4ec3-acea-4dd7077f8a6e"],
 ". To find the relations between reciprocal basis in the primed system the \
