1}=\\mathrm{e}_{1}-\\mathrm{e}_{2}+\\mathrm{e}_{3}=\\mathrm{e}_{}^1-\\mathrm{\
e}_{}^2+\\mathrm{e}_{}^3", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a05ce929-bfd3-4321-b843-b8bc98b6d42e"],
 ". Similarly, one can find  ",
