Cell["\<\
Many of formulas provided in two tables above were already checked. In \
particular, entire first table was verified (formulas with metric will be \
covered below), and a first six formulas of the second table.  Here we check \
the rest ones\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"15625696-ccda-43d5-bbed-404154384cfd"],

