  "c84680a7-5ee8-4012-9578-164e664ab57e"],
 " we have that the individual terms in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", FontSlant -> "Plain"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "(", 
