Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 
 CounterBox["Section"],
 ".",
 
 CounterBox["Item"],
 "\t",
 StyleBox["Blades (aka k-vectors or simple MVs)",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ". The general MV in n-dimensional space may consist of sums of scalars ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Alpha]", ",", "\[Beta]", ",", "\[Ellipsis]", "\[Element]"}],
        TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\alpha,\\beta,\\ldots\\in", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "84d33e93-08bb-471d-9776-7ee7b6cdab9a"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[ScriptCapitalG]", "0"], "n"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"04a92ce6-adf6-4ea3-9968-617cbe7a3e52"],
 " , vectors ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["a", "TI"], ",", 
         StyleBox["b", "TI"], ",", 
         StyleBox["c", "TI"], ",", "\[Ellipsis]", "\[Element]"}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "a,b,c,\\ldots\\in", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7ddd00b0-2fa6-45c6-b20c-64a396058987"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[ScriptCapitalG]", "1"], "n"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"ff76b4e4-ec01-4c3b-b3fa-a4092757ffa7"],
 " , bivectors ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", 
         StyleBox["b", "TI"], ", ", 
         StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", 
         StyleBox["c", "TI"], ", ", 
         StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", 
         StyleBox["c", "TI"], ",", "\[Ellipsis]", "\[Element]"}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "a\\w b,\\, a\\w c,\\, b\\w c,\\ldots\\in", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "8cfd1c41-56d6-42ef-a7ec-391b8129874d"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[ScriptCapitalG]", "2"], "n"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"5b576676-dbfc-4fb5-81a5-96244bee0fde"],
 " , trivectors\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", 
         StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", 
         StyleBox["c", "TI"], ",", "\[Ellipsis]", "\[Element]"}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "a\\w b\\w c,\\ldots\\in",
      "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ca979696-2e00-403b-b7c9-7fe5351d94f8"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[ScriptCapitalG]", "3"], "n"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"ad94f6ca-30be-47a1-b514-798d1c579aad"],
 ", etc, where each of the outer products is constructed from linearly \
independent vectors that span the respective subspace ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[ScriptCapitalG]", "r"], "n"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"3b0ce007-a095-44ce-a850-59cc0c21e3f6"],
 " . The outer product of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["r", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "r", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "785e7560-c7f3-494c-a6d6-f593fade5eba"],
 " linearly independent vectors\n\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["r", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubsuperscriptBox["\[Wedge]", 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], 
          StyleBox["r", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], ":", "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], "1"], "\[Wedge]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], "2"], "\[Wedge]", "\[CenterEllipsis]", 
         "\[Wedge]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["r", "TI"]], ",  ", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "\[Element]"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "A_r=\\big\\wedge_{i=1}^r a_i:=a_1\\w a_2\\w\\cdots\\w a_r,\\quad\n\
a_i\\in", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ad06d5e3-9c88-48c4-b5f0-79051471987c"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[ScriptCapitalG]", "1"], "n"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"b086d799-c3b6-482c-a23a-75a65df6b9d2"],
 " ,\n\nis called the Grassmann product, or r-blade.Thus, 1-blade is a \
vector, 2-blade  is a bivector (oriented plane), 3-blade is a trivector \
(oriented volume) and, generally, r-blade represents the oriented  \
hypervolume in r-dimensional (sub)space.  The largest outer product in nD \
vector space, namely ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubsuperscriptBox["\[Wedge]", 
          RowBox[{
            StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "1"}], 
          StyleBox["n", "TI"]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["i", "TI"]]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\big\\wedge_{i=1}^n a_i", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3103c42e-2fe2-4055-8787-9f2ef2188505"],
 ", has ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       StyleBox["n", "TI"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "n", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e9a4ea76-2684-4f83-8571-62ac6d8d2af4"],
 " factors and is called the pseudoscalar. Up to scalar it is unique and \
always stands as a single geometric object. The specific non-oriented \
positive entities like vector length ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       TemplateBox[{
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["a", "TI"]}]}, "Abs"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "\\abs{a}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b1a57275-5dd2-47de-b5f7-62a6639456b3"],
 ", bivector area ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       TemplateBox[{
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["B", "TI"]}]}, "Abs"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "\\abs{\\cB}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "23743647-e0a8-467f-b7c5-6e016b6d7e70"],
 ", or trivector volume ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       TemplateBox[{
         RowBox[{
           StyleBox["T", "TI"]}]}, "Abs"], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "\\abs{T}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5b18d243-b536-4a4d-ac97-31de5526c6c7"],
 " etc., commonly are called the magnitudes of blades. In a short form the \
r-blade is written as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["A", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["r", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "A_r", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "d6da994b-b3a7-47bb-82a1-48db32325a3f"],
 ". On the other hand the grade selector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        RowBox[{"\[LeftAngleBracket]", "..", "\[RightAngleBracket]"}], 
        StyleBox["r", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\langle ..\\rangle_r", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "005130e3-2d8e-4ce3-9066-400722ae8429"],
 " may yield a more general object, i.e. may include a sum of blades, which \
can or cannot be reduced to a single r-blade by selecting an appropriate \
frame. The key property of a blade is that it always can be reduced and \
interpreted as a single hypervolume in the subspace ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SuperscriptBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[ScriptCapitalG]", "r"], "n"], TraditionalForm]],
  ExpressionUUID->"fbd2e2b9-4787-4258-8ed0-a27db744fd06"],
 "."
}], "Item",ExpressionUUID->"bc5b91fe-d514-4c53-912a-f866d794d6d9"],

