Cell["\<\
To test first bar expression in terms of binomial conjugations we will use \
the same method as described above for obtaining a scalar part (since these \
formulas are direct consequence) \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7998e3c3-7390-4957-9b7f-5001a4cb7e48"],

