Cell["\<\
For  bivectors which are true blades, and which can be reduced to a single \
blade, for example, for 2\[DoubleStruckE][1,2]+3e[1,4] the magnitude \
geometric interpretation is the area of parallelepiped made of both vectors\
\>", "Text",
