Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["gaNorm2CliffordConjugateSigned[ ]",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " returns multivector, not scalar. So strictly speaking it is not a norm.  \
Often we need normalized multivector by specific norm. This can be done with ",
 StyleBox["gaNormalize[] ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",
