Cell["\<\
We only will test  properties of left and right contractions, since similar \
properties for inner, outer and geometric  products were already verified. \
First define short notations for a vector and bivector. \
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4167d487-40a8-4a0d-8d75-70a2eb56ae5c"],

